119: ## AndroidWorld, development seed 30
120: 
121: Seed 30 was used to choose between versions, so these are development numbers. Source:
122: [`results/androidworld/dev_seed30_summary.md`](../results/androidworld/dev_seed30_summary.md).
123: 
124: | Model | Successes / 116 | Answer / 25 | Action / 91 | Exceptions | Apple M5 s/step (median) |
125: |---|---|---|---|---|---|
126: | **LFM3-VL-2B v4 (final)** | **18** | 6 | 12 | 4 | 2.96 |
127: | MAI-UI-2B (1 screenshot, 8-bit) | 32 | 5 | 27 | 1 | 9.35 |
128: | GUI-Owl-1.5-2B (1 screenshot) | 23 | 10 | 13 | 0 | 7.00 |
129: | Qwen3.5-2B v1 | 16 | 0 | 16 | 2 | 4.20 |
130: | LFM3-VL-2B v1 | 15 | 0 | 15 | 2 | 2.66 |
131: | LFM3-VL-2B v3 | 13 | 0 | 13 | 3 | 2.61 |
132: | Qwen3.5-0.8B v1 | 12 | 0 | 12 | 1 | 2.00 |
133: | LFM3-VL-2B v1 + runtime feedback (ablation) | 10 | 0 | 10 | 7 | 2.85 |
134: | LFM3-VL-2B v2 + forced intent (ablation) | 6 | 0 | 6 | 4 | 2.68 |
135: | LFM3-VL-2B v2 | 3 | 0 | 3 | 5 | 2.61 |
136: | LFM2.5-VL-450M v1 | 2 | 0 | 2 | 4 | 1.14 |
137: | LFM3-VL-2B base | 1 | 0 | 1 | 2 | 2.13 |
138: | LFM2.5-VL-450M base | 0 | 0 | 0 | 3 | 2.21 |
139: 
140: - **MAI-UI-2B is the strongest model on this seed.** It ran later as an extra arm and is not part of the
141:   preregistered comparison. It needs 8-bit weights because its 4-bit output degenerates
142:   ([`results/maiui_quant_check.md`](../results/maiui_quant_check.md)). Its official prompt lists AndroidWorld's apps.
143: - GUI-Owl's seed-30 run did not get the installed-app list that v4 gets. The held-out runs give it to both.
144: - v4 passed its preregistered development gate on this seed ([`results/v4_gate_seed30.txt`](../results/v4_gate_seed30.txt)).
145: 
